  "html": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":2388,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_9338-768x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2388\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Neuographic circle art without the neuropathic part 😂 The process is fast, fun, and easy.. just like I like it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note to self : <a href=\"https://youtu.be/G76X8uO3Wnk?si=th2I6HCfse9SlYVU\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://youtu.be/G76X8uO3Wnk?si=th2I6HCfse9SlYVU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Circles : Neographic Basics</a> This video poppped up randomly in my feed and lead to many pages of the above.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supplies Used :  Uniball Vision .7, B6 Stalogy </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
